From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LECH OS <dev@lech-os.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Hide the launcher entries replaced by the own apps of LECH OS
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

LECH Nastavenia, LECH Súbory, LECH Telefón and LECH PDF replace the
launcher entries of Settings, DocumentsUI, the Dialer and the GrapheneOS
PDF viewer; the apps themselves stay for their system roles. The list
was in a resource overlay (LechLauncherOverlay), but the all-apps list
still showed Súbory, Nastavenia and PDF Viewer twice (12. 11. 2026).
The overlay had no effect, probably because Launcher3QuickStep is built
with shrink_resources (resource names need not survive for an overlay).
The list is now in the launcher's own config.xml, which AppFilter reads.
---
 res/values/config.xml | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/res/values/config.xml b/res/values/config.xml
index 2211b9c..942ba71 100644
--- a/res/values/config.xml
+++ b/res/values/config.xml
@@ -133,5 +133,14 @@
     </array>
 
-    <string-array name="filtered_components" ></string-array>
+    <!-- LECH OS: launcher entries replaced by the own apps of LECH OS (vendor/lech/aplikacie). The apps stay: Settings
+         and DocumentsUI provide the settings screens and the system file picker, the Dialer the in-call screen and
+         the GrapheneOS PDF viewer renders the PDF files LECH PDF opens. In the source: a resource overlay of this
+         array had no effect on the phone (Launcher3QuickStep is built with shrink_resources). -->
+    <string-array name="filtered_components" translatable="false">
+        <item>com.android.settings/com.android.settings.Settings</item>
+        <item>com.android.documentsui/com.android.documentsui.LauncherActivity</item>
+        <item>com.android.dialer/com.android.dialer.main.impl.MainActivity</item>
+        <item>app.grapheneos.pdfviewer/app.grapheneos.pdfviewer.PdfViewer</item>
+    </string-array>
     <string-array name="default_featured_widget_apps" translatable="false">
     </string-array>
-- 
